single call 0: edit -> src/types.ts, src/commands.ts, src/format.ts, src/commands.test.ts, src/format.test.ts, src/storage.test.ts, src/types.test.ts  (Renamed Todo.done to Todo.completed in types.ts and updated every reader/writer (commands.ts add/complete/list, format.ts formatTodo) plus test fixtures. ListOptions.includeDone is a separate public option, not Todo.done, so it is left unchanged. Note: the on-disk JSON key changes too; storage.load casts without migration, so pre-existing files with "done" would load with completed undefined (treated as not completed).)
round 1: oracle GREEN
